OL,3,GNEWSAWork set to start on Eden
OL,4,AProject's Sunshine garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is set to start on the garden at
OL,7,Fthe entrance of the Eden Project
OL,8,FMorecambe, with the site being prepared
OL,9,Fto receive its first plants.
OL,11,FA mix of species designed to thrive in
OL,12,Fcoastal areas have been transported
OL,13,Ffrom an award-winning garden at this
OL,14,Fyear's RHS Chelsea Flower Show 2026 to
OL,15,Fthe seaside resort to create the new
OL,16,Feco-attraction.
OL,18,FThe Bring Me Sunshine Garden, inspired
OL,19,Fby comedian Eric Morecambe, was
OL,20,Fdesigned with the help of young adults
OL,21,Ffrom the town that are not currently in
OL,22,Femployment or education.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
